  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The most basic, easy to understand broadcast setting, which is also the most important to learn and use, is the Local broadcast. This is used to make buttons that turn on/off music or a mirror locally, which is so badly needed in so many worlds. Why is this super useful, so easy to understand, super needed broadcast type hidden under a checkbox for 'Advanced Mode' in the SDK for VRC_Triggers?\n\nPlease move it to the basic set. This may sound like it doesn't make a difference, but many people never click that mode and don't notice that Local broadcast type even exists. The more people that are aware of it, the more worlds will be more likely to have buttons to locally disable/enable things to make everyone's experience that much better.\n\nThanks~",
